    "show_share": true,
    "description": "High OHSE standards at AKU earned a 'Best Practices in Health, Safety and Environment' award from the Employers' Federation of Pakistan (EFP). The award was part of a nationwide competition organised by the EFP in collaboration with the International Labour Organization (ILO) to commemorate \"International Day on Health and Safety\" on April 28, 2008.",
